OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStorm Boelo brings widespread
OL,6,Fwesterly severe gales. Frequent
OL,7,Fshowers in the morning, heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes, with drier interludes
OL,9,Fdeveloping from the afternoon. Winds
OL,10,Fgradually easing from the west later
OL,11,Fin the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStrong winds at first will
OL,14,Fgradually ease through the evening and
OL,15,Fovernight. Scattered showers from the
OL,16,Fwest at first, becoming dry with clear
OL,17,Fspells overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
