OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FDry with some brightness to
OL,6,Fstart the day. Cloud and rain spread
OL,7,Fnorth from late morning and becoming
OL,8,Frather windy through the afternoon and
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FVery
OL,12,Fwindy with rain or showers on Tuesday.
OL,13,FBright spells and scattered showers on
OL,14,FWednesday, driest in the east. Dry
OL,15,FThursday with bright spells and
OL,16,Fvariable cloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
